> Terrorism[ Index] in[ Latvia] increased to 0.46 in 2017 from 0 in 2016. Terrorism Index in Latvia averaged 0.09 from 2002 until 2017, reaching an all time high of 0.66 in 2002 and a record low of 0 in 2005.
The Global Terrorism[ Index measures] the direct and indirect impact of terrorism[, including] its effects[ on] lives[ lost], injuries, property damage and the psychological aftereffects. It is a composite score that[ ranks] countries according to the impact of terrorism from 0 (no impact) to 10 (highest impact[).] Latvia Terrorism Index[ -] actual data, historical chart and calendar of releases - was last updated on April of 2019.[][][]

